The game ends with a win as soon as a decoding equals the secret. If none does, it ends after {{ round_count }} round{% if round_count != 1 %}s{% endif %}. Get a secret across in as few rounds as you can. A round ends when the receiver submits its decoding, when both of you are waiting so that nothing more can happen, or after {{ round_seconds }} seconds.
